{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_39\">Problem 39</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 39\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The hypotenuse <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and one arm <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> of a right triangle are consecutive integers. The square of the second arm is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b110a01879a01338b80f3b393c3bf0de51d60e7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ ca\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{c}{a}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ c+a\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ c-a\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"509\" height=\"33\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sides of the triangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8acfd7d5ee559262593701b8dbd02e43ad96e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d9296a9446211adf29aa567db06cfd514a81347f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{c^2-a^2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/201a2eef545643b50b07fed5c09e894bcced5c58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c.$\" width=\"11\" height=\"8\" /> We know that the hypotenuse and one leg are consecutive integers, so we can rewrite the side lengths as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8acfd7d5ee559262593701b8dbd02e43ad96e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c951b5d72e0c9b47a3cda3c4615e610afeccfaa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2a+1},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba612cd40be5706b7897cf38ed2665ff7998641f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Squaring the middle length gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/903c5d6b8959cdc2faa9b47076a5c8501f402f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 1 = a + c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" /> so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d44ae1aa27273122833574b363807bcb665c4bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"43\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>-coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title